abstract: >-
  Public code reference containing the recommended Jetson bee-sleep detector,
  historical detector scripts, audited cleaning and plotting code, MATLAB
  comparison functions, and offline tests. Experimental data and private
  correspondence are not included. Released under BSD-3-Clause.
keywords:
